lmms-web: Organic's OscillatorObject under a name of its own in the web build: TripleOscillator
has an lmms::OscillatorObject too, and the web build links every plugin into one module.

Applies to LMMS v1.3.0-alpha.2 (GPL-2.0-or-later).

diff --git a/plugins/Organic/CMakeLists.txt b/plugins/Organic/CMakeLists.txt
index 797c845..875d898 100644
--- a/plugins/Organic/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/plugins/Organic/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,3 +1,9 @@
 INCLUDE(BuildPlugin)
 
 BUILD_PLUGIN(organic Organic.cpp Organic.h MOCFILES Organic.h EMBEDDED_RESOURCES *.png)
+
+if(LMMS_BUILD_WEB)
+	# TripleOscillator has an lmms::OscillatorObject too. Loaded as separate libraries they never meet; in the one module the
+	# web build links they would clash, so here Organic's goes by a name of its own
+	target_compile_definitions(organic PRIVATE OscillatorObject=OrganicOscillatorObject)
+endif()
